# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Existing source is not yet Prettier-formatted.
#
# Reformatting ~35 files in one go would bury this repo's real diffs and
# conflict with every branch currently in flight. Everything NEW is formatted
# and checked (see the `format:check` script), so the formatted surface grows
# rather than arriving as one unreviewable commit.
#
# To adopt Prettier repo-wide, in one deliberate change:
#   1. delete this block
#   2. change `format:check` back to `prettier --check .`
#   3. npm run format
#   4. commit on its own, then add the SHA to .git-blame-ignore-revs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
